# Extra hosts allowed by the Next.js image optimizer (comma-separated hostnames),
# e.g. your MinIO/CDN domain. API/app URL hosts are allowed automatically.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_IMAGE_HOSTS=cdn.gowtam.com,media.gowtam.com

# Custom-domain gateway targets shown in the store DNS setup instructions.
# Customers point their CNAME at GATEWAY_HOST (recommended) or an A record at
# GATEWAY_IP. These must resolve to the Caddy reverse proxy.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_HOST=gateway.gowtam.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_IP=1.2.3.4